    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Strings</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Vertical scan</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/longest-common-prefix/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 14</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Longest Common Prefix</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Read the strings column by column and stop at the first column where any string ends or disagrees: you never read past the answer by more than one column. O(S) time where S ≤ n·(answer + 1) characters, O(1) extra space.</p>\n"
